      "instance_name": "Facebook_content_moderation_policy",
      "label": "Facebook's Content Moderation Policy",
      "description": "The meme leverages the public perception of Facebook as a platform that moderates user-generated content. The challenge to post 'offensive memes' implicitly critiques or mocks the platform's policies, suggesting a dare to bypass or challenge those rules. Understanding this requires knowledge of Facebook's role in moderating online content and its public image regarding censorship or freedom of expression.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
