      "description": "The meme uses Mark Zuckerberg's image to represent the authority figure of Facebook. His public persona as the CEO of a major social media company is leveraged to create a sense of challenge or dare. Understanding the meme requires knowledge of his role and the public perception of him as the face of Facebook and its policies.",
