      "label": "Social Media Platforms as Content Dissemination Channels",
      "description": "The meme implies that offensive memes can be posted and spread through social media platforms like Facebook. Understanding the meme requires knowledge of how social media functions as a channel for content dissemination, including the potential for rapid spread and the role of algorithms in amplifying controversial content.",
