      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User is projected onto the dare challenge presented in the text",
      "description": "The user is implicitly projected onto the dare by the text 'post your most offensive memes' and 'winner gets a 30 day vacation who dares win?'. The use of 'your' and 'who dares win?' directly addresses the viewer, inviting them to participate in the challenge. This creates a direct semiotic projection where the user is positioned as the potential challenger or participant in the dare.",
