      "description": "The meme encourages users to post offensive content as a dare, leveraging Mark Zuckerberg's public persona and Facebook's content moderation policies to provoke engagement. This incentivizes the creation and spread of toxic, discriminatory, or inflammatory content, which can contribute to a harmful online environment.",
